      "All components adhere to valid-ready handshake protocol.",
      "Skid buffer provides one-entry FIFO with bypass capability.",
      "Stream fork is combinational and duplicates input to both outputs.",
      "Stream stage adds a single pipeline register to data and valid signals.",
      "Reset is synchronous active-low."
    ]
